Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm God, you see!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And this smell...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.75,0:00:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,God my ass!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.93,0:00:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't do any—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You runaway brat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You ignorant fools!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.10,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The great principle of capitalism is give-and-take.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.18,0:00:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as give-and-give!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am God.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.19,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You came looking for love,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.16,0:00:45.12,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,and yet you reject me?{TODO ugh wat do}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I physically can't stand his looks or his smell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always hard to understand how you girls think.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.21,0:00:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But we agree on that, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.51,0:01:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you haven't gone far.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.18,0:01:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even back then, you only went \None subway stop from home.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You got scared and ran back home,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.86,0:01:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but there was no place for you, was there?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents don't love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who will.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.62,0:01:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When you ran away, weren't you saved for a moment?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was blowing off steam.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.50,0:01:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of relationship you should have built.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You must understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's blow off each other's steam.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow it off for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.45,0:02:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.00,0:02:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.04,0:02:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.67,0:02:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But why's his mind down there?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.25,0:02:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I eat will taste right for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.26,0:02:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.85,0:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give-and-give would just be gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.98,0:02:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But it made me happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Having somebody protect me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.95,0:02:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.33,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a little late.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is hard to find.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.13,0:04:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.67,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You got lost?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.72,0:04:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.31,0:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.89,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in! It's cramped, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.32,0:04:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Aonuma Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.73,0:04:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, how polite.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ai's Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.45,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.70,0:04:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.41,0:04:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Aren't you Mr. Sawaki's...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.08,0:04:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Momoe. I'm his niece.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pretty young lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.71,0:05:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Th—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have that cake?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay out Neiru's snacks, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.84,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have so many friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.55,0:05:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.73,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are shameless.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't even finished yours.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.77,0:05:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stingy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.85,0:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.06,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you're really my uncle's student, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear he's crazy popular with the girls at school.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were a guy, I'd want to date you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.08,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Koito liked Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.37,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl Ai's trying to save.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.30,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had a crazy idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.05,0:06:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ai's best friend Koito \Nwas actually dating Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, something terrible happened, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.82,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh? Do you have company?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.82,0:06:10.44,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,We do. Ai's friends are here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.44,0:06:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My uncle's not like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.24,0:06:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so nice that he adopts lots of rescue cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just likes cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.62,0:06:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He might have a dark side.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.66,0:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A teacher got hands on with a student,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.84,0:06:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and when it got dicey, bam! Just like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.67,0:06:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got pregnant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.01,0:06:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pregnant?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pregnant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.01,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pregnant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.35,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.85,0:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.27,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know why Koito died.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.87,0:06:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not ask your mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.87,0:07:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mr. Sawaki told her something.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.09,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe he only checks on you every week
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.96,0:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,because he thinks you've got some kind of proof.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be it, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't ask.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.93,0:07:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom really trusts Mr. Sawaki, \Nand I'm always making her worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.48,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And she stopped asking about my injuries \Nafter I clammed up about them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Clammed," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You got allergies?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.65,0:07:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just that I can picture Ai as a clam.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.28,0:07:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you tell her you're going out to fight in your sleep,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.25,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll just worry her more.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She might think you're on something.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd never believe you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.88,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.63,0:08:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our story that no one else knows about, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.60,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A story... that no one knows about.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.02,0:08:08.23,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Momoe's here?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.23,0:08:11.48,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yes, I recognized her because she looks like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.98,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,They're in different schools. Where did they meet?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.87,0:08:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll paint how you look to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.91,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's finished, I want you to have confidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, confident?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.71,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.55,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize \Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.18,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.56,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.50,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish my mom was more like yours, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What's yours like?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.25,0:09:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's toxic and awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet when I was born and first saw her face, I thought,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.00,0:09:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"This lady wants to stay a woman her \Nwhole life and never be a parent."
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, no! What do I do?"
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.14,0:09:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom always does everything \Nperfectly, at work and at home.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She works really hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.35,0:09:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think that's probably why my dad left.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.69,0:09:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of guys are proud.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A capable woman actually spoils them.{TODO spoils?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.41,0:09:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's your turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.03,0:09:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an anachronistic fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "fool"?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.17,0:09:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.21,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They really get along, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.39,0:10:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.76,0:10:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this spot?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you do hair treatments?{TODO hair treatments}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've got some damage.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.28,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be free. Don't tie me down.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.45,0:10:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't my hair pretty?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single split end.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.37,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my prettiest now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.42,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can replace youth.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.34,0:10:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to ask? About why I died?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.42,0:10:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just complete my objectives.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.39,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.93,0:10:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls become adults.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.44,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The miraculous beauty of a butterfly emerging.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A brief moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.91,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment of shocking beauty when its \Ntransience is powerfully reflected.{TODO wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.74,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.58,0:11:20.13,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Soon, beauty fades.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.88,0:11:23.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,My mom's just a sow.{TODO ugh}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.05,0:11:26.68,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,No amount of liposuction or hyaluronic acid
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.51,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,will ever stop her aging.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.51,0:11:33.64,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,In fact, her attempts to stop it \Nare unbelievably ugly on their own.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.64,0:11:37.14,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're pretty, too. Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.69,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Why not die when you're at your most beautiful?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.69,0:11:41.98,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Why cling to a meaningless life?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.36,0:11:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.82,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I beat them?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.45,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.53,0:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.53,0:11:47.74,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.07,0:11:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.07,0:11:50.32,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.53,0:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.53,0:11:50.74,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.82,0:11:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.82,0:11:54.66,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.70,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.87,0:11:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.63,0:12:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, coast's clear.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.13,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The crosswalk is right there.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to wait?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.34,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot, huh, Momo?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.22,0:12:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bunch, actually.{TODO akshully}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.81,0:12:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.97,0:12:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's an echo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.73,0:12:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they grew here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.81,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me; I'm starving.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.98,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,About six times, I think.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is six times a lot or a little?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.32,0:12:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.53,0:12:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.49,0:12:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They all seriously say they love me. It's a pain.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.58,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiration, maybe?{TODO meh}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.33,0:12:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like with Takarazuka?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.09,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't like {that}it, right, Momo?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.30,0:12:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.38,0:12:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,God sure is cruel.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.51,0:12:53.08,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Outside food and drink are prohibited.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.50,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,More importantly, buy your Eggs and leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let us play one game.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.81,0:13:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is basically a kind of group therapy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to let us feel that we're not alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.73,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We might kill ourselves without it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.87,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Just one game.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.87,0:13:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.25,0:13:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even reach the pins before.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting buff.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.38,0:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God for Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.30,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.71,0:13:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.97,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a date photo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.01,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All my photos with girls come out like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.89,0:13:36.22,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll save it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.52,0:13:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this picture's cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.02,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka took this one for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.90,0:13:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka was willing to see me as a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.61,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend who killed herself?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.61,0:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.99,0:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But she suddenly took her clothes off in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.45,0:14:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She put the moves on you? Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.41,0:14:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got scared and ended up pushing her away.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.54,0:14:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't expect it to come from a girl who's your friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.00,0:14:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I got chills! I was shaking!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I have done?{TODO maybe snap}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.14,0:14:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's drop the gloomy talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.77,0:14:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There are lots of other games. Let's play our hearts out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.23,0:14:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.40,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.40,0:14:33.11,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd only play one game.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.41,0:14:35.70,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Buy Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.70,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,This place is—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.02,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.54,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Where's the harm?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.54,0:14:48.00,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Play well, fight well.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't completely hate being popular, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with girls?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.89,0:15:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I care about the girls \Nwho follow me on Insta and things.{TODO stuff?}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're half-hearted.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.48,0:15:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you end up enjoying something \Neven though you didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.58,0:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.28,0:15:16.99,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.99,0:15:18.16,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.49,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.16,0:15:23.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I couldn't beat you even once.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.41,0:15:25.25,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Games like that are kind of my thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.33,Default,,0,460,0,,That was a first.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.21,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,A gamer? You secretly a nerd?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.33,0:15:27.21,Default,,390,0,0,,Same for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.38,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,That's normal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.59,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're totally a nerd.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.17,0:15:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had your fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.59,0:15:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, buy your Eggs, go home, and go to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.21,0:15:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I don't wanna leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.63,0:15:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having the time of my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I haven't had this much fun in ages.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.06,0:15:47.69,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Good grief. It's your fault for spoiling them.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.31,0:15:52.90,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm not spoiling them; soldiers need their rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.73,0:15:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah; Neiru, can I have your contact info?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.82,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Tell me yours, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.90,0:15:56.70,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Too much rest will make them slack off like you do.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Here's mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.82,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're so uptight.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.82,0:16:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we just stop buying Eggs?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.37,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.20,0:16:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, Chiemi went and died on her own.{TODO maybe snap end}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.25,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be true that I was the reason,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but dying isn't playing fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to feel so responsible?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.55,0:16:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. What Ai saw was just an act.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.84,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.18,0:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a woman, so I get swept away \Nby my emotions in the moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.31,0:16:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.77,0:16:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Momoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.35,0:16:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you responsible?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.98,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you feel guilty. So do I.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.36,0:16:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But should we really feel so \Nresponsible that we'd risk our own lives?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.49,0:16:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,stop it already.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially you, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.79,0:16:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She died without even talking to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.67,0:16:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not your fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.51,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why do you have to go fight?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.01,0:17:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to know the truth about why Koito died.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.68,0:17:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That curiosity could get you killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.94,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My{\i0} parents are one thing, but you've got a great mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.10,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to make her sad?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.40,0:17:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know if Koito {\i1}wants{\i0} \Nto come back to life in the first place!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.41,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.91,0:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did Koito's statue tell you she wants to come back?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.20,0:17:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, stop it—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.21,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to be the bad guy!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.17,0:17:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want friends, you've got 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.80,0:17:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go, but I have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.93,0:17:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone selfish enough to... kill themselves...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.01,0:17:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, Neiru's trying to save her sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.81,0:17:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.39,0:17:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong about what?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.23,0:17:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.61,0:18:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.99,0:18:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they told me when I woke up in the ICU.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you've got even less of a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.62,0:18:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.84,0:18:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.64,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.78,0:18:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.86,0:18:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilt and curiosity fade. Sooner or later, you'll forget 'em.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.11,0:18:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.91,0:18:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that's just adolescence.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.54,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beauty is a momentary season of metamorphosis.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.54,0:19:01.30,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?{TODO this whole thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.30,0:19:02.92,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Dying is the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.92,0:19:06.26,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Killing your own beautiful body is another metamorphosis.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.26,0:19:10.51,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Getting old and ugly or trying \Nto resist aging are both comedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.89,0:19:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a real one.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.51,0:19:11.81,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Just comedy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.81,0:19:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.55,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.21,0:19:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.02,0:19:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.58,0:19:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.30,0:19:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.13,0:19:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.30,0:19:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got on my nerves.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.55,0:19:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually regret it, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.68,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, no one will call you pretty ever again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.11,0:20:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Why don't I die," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.36,0:20:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You tempted me to die, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.99,0:20:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.24,0:20:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Teenage rebellion.
